	<TextRow
		Label="msg_c06r0101_middleman2_01"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>なんで　かっそうろの　まわりに
ビニルハウスを　つくるのか？▼
そりゃ　とれたてやさいを
いっこくも　はやく　はこぶためよ</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-08-18T02:53:12" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:12" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>なんで　滑走路の　周りに
ビニルハウスを　つくるのか？▼
そりゃ　採れたて野菜を
一刻も　速く　運ぶためよ</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-08-18T02:54:07" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:12" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<CommentCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Comment>♂：Black2ver
※swanでメッセージ修正</Comment>
			<CommentModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2012-01-11T11:45:22" />
		</CommentCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Character">
			<Text>太ったおじさん</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:12" />
		</AttributeCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Importance">
			<Text>C</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2012-01-11T11:45:29" />
		</AttributeCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Width">
			<Text>256</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:12" />
		</AttributeCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="msg_c06r0101_middleman2_01w"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>なんで　かっそうろの　まわりに
はたけを　つくるのか？▼
そりゃ　とれたてやさいを
いっこくも　はやく　はこぶためよ</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-08-18T02:53:07" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:12" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>なんで　滑走路の　周りに
畑を　つくるのか？▼
そりゃ　採れたて野菜を
一刻も　速く　運ぶためよ</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-08-18T02:54:13" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:12" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<CommentCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Comment>♂：White2ver
※swanでメッセージ修正</Comment>
			<CommentModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2012-01-11T11:45:25" />
		</CommentCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Character">
			<Text>太ったおじさん</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:12" />
		</AttributeCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Importance">
			<Text>C</Text>
